# zram swap.
#
# Single deterministic writer: swapon_all processes this file (init core
# domain), sizes zram0 and swaps it on after vendor modules are ready
# (see init.asteroids.rc). comp_algorithm is set from init.target.rc on
# init, which is valid because system_dlkm (zram.ko/zsmalloc.ko) is loaded
# during first-stage init, before second-stage init runs.
#
# Size: QCOM default for >=4GB targets is 50% of RAM capped at 4GiB, which
# is 4GiB for both the 8GB and 12GB SKUs. Stock Nothing shipped 2GiB
# (fstab.zram.2g); 4GiB matches the QCOM formula and reduces LMK churn.
#
#<src>               <mnt_point> <mnt_flags> <fs_mgr_flags>
/dev/block/zram0      none        swap        defaults zramsize=4294967296
